<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1910_7113.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnßer fründtlich willig diennst, und was wir
<lb n="2"/>mehr ehrn, liebs und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guots</unclear> vermögen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuovor</unclear>, Für-
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sichtig</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Erßame</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weiße</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beßonnders</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">liebe</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">frünndt</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guote</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nachbarn</unclear>.
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnßers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jüngsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethonen</unclear>
<lb n="6"/>schreibens, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dießelbige</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frünndtlich</unclear> be-
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">richten</unclear>, demnach uns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürkhomen</unclear>, wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> deß
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Oberisten</unclear> V. <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Madrutz</unclear></persName> im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-108" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schwaben</unclear> land</placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geworbne</unclear>
<lb n="9"/>kriegs volckh und soldaten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allberait</unclear> ein guote an-
<lb n="10"/>zahl, doch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rotten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weiß</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">under</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weegen</unclear>, und an heut
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dato</unclear>, wie die sag, in 200. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alheer</unclear> in unnßer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oberkhait</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khomen</unclear> sollen, haben wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnßern</unclear> burger, haubtman
<lb n="13"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jacoben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Raitner</unclear></persName>, so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heut</unclear> am <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">morgen</unclear> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-87" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rorschach</unclear></placeName>,
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> kriegs <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weeßens</unclear> halb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alheer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khomen</unclear>, in dießer
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stundt</unclear> für unns beschickht, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">souil</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihm</unclear> vernomen,
<lb n="16"/>ob wol der herr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Oberiste</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-69" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Lucern</placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heraußßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ent</unclear>-
<lb n="17"/>botten, das die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">paß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> kriegs volckh, so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inns</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-311" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Mailändisch</placeName> gebiett <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ziehen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschaiden</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">offen</unclear>, seye
<lb n="19"/>doch solches nit, wie dann der herr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Prelat</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">St.
<lb n="20"/>Gallen</placeName>, den, noch der zeit, nit geben khünde, Dero-
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Er</unclear> haubtman <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Raitner</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vom</unclear> Oberisten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Leüt</unclear>-
<lb n="22"/>ampt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-87" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rorschach</unclear></placeName>, mit etwas <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dargeschoßnem</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>gellt, dahin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">behandlet</unclear> worden, daß er die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alheer</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khomende</unclear> soldaten, noch der zeit, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bis</unclear> der
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1910_7114.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="25"/>paß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geöfnet</unclear> werde mit etwas gellt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffhallten</unclear>,
<lb n="26"/>und sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zur</unclear> gedult <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ermanen</unclear> solle.
<lb n="27"/>Und weil unß daneben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernerß</unclear> fürkhomen, daß
<lb n="28"/>die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtsleüt</unclear> im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-103" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Turgäuw</unclear></placeName>, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinüber</unclear> fahrende
<lb n="29"/>soldaten, gar nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anß</unclear> landt khomen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, sonder
<lb n="30"/>wider <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rugk</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weisen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear>, wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> auch wol
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermueten</unclear>, E. E. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. solches nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuwider</unclear>, haben
<lb n="32"/>wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemelten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">reüter</unclear> dahin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erinert</unclear>, daß
<lb n="33"/>er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eillend</unclear> sich uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weeg</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mach</unclear>, und etlich be=
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khante</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rugk</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">danen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heer</unclear> die soldaten
<lb n="35"/>khomen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schikhe</unclear>, unß, weil die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">päß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gespörth</unclear>,
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> sy, die soldaten, nit allein nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorthziechen</unclear>,
<lb n="37"/>sonder sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eintwederß</unclear> wider <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rugk</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weichen</unclear>,
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">od</unclear> sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">usserhalb</unclear> unserer oberkheit, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffhallten</unclear>,
<lb n="39"/>Und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear> wir, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">souil</unclear> möglich, dahin handlen,
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> diß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kriegsvolkh</unclear> weder unß noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andn</unclear>
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genachbarten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschwärlich</unclear> seye.
<lb n="42"/>Welches wir E. E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bej</unclear> disem, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserem</unclear>
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aig</unclear> darumb abgesandten botten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbare=</unclear>
<lb n="44"/>lich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolmeinung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuobericht</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underlaßen</unclear>
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear>, mit bitt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> hinwider <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuuerstendigen</unclear>
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> sy dergleich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">so</unclear> vernemen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sind</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue=</unclear>
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">samt</unclear> demselben angenehm lieb und dienst. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dat</unclear>
<lb n="48"/><origDate when="1614-08-29" resp="#ner">29. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Augustj</unclear> umb. 10 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uhr</unclear>. Anno <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">1614</unclear></origDate>.
